{"last_link_id": 25, "nodes": [{"mode": 2, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [2], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [400, 396], "pos": [580.4315185546875, -93.84427642822266], "widgets_values": ["auto", "有些人喜欢被照顾，\n而我更习惯照亮自己。\n\n不是不需要依靠，\n只是明白——\n真正能陪你走到最后的，\n从来都不是运气。\n\n我见过凌晨四点的城市，\n也见过掌声散去后的安静。\n那些看起来毫不费力的从容，\n其实都藏着一次次咬牙坚持。\n\n你可以说我清醒，\n也可以说我冷静。\n但只有我自己知道，\n每一次选择背后，\n我都为自己负责。\n\n世界很吵，\n声音太多了。\n有人教你妥协，\n有人劝你低头，\n也有人告诉你——\n\"算了吧，别太认真。\"\n\n可偏偏是认真，\n让我走到今天。\n\n我喜欢掌控节奏，\n喜欢在风来的时候站稳，\n也喜欢在夜深人静时，\n对自己说一句：\n\"今天，做得不错。\"\n\n我不急着证明什么，\n时间会替我说话。\n我不害怕孤独，\n因为独处让我更清楚——\n我想要什么，\n我值得什么。\n\n如果你也正在路上，\n别急。\n慢一点没关系，\n走稳一点就好。\n\n你不需要成为别人期待的样子，\n你只需要成为——\n那个连自己都欣赏的人。\n\n这一路，\n我会继续走下去。\n不张扬，\n不退场，\n刚刚好地，\n发着光。", 133534916351271, "randomize", 1.7, 0.8, 25, 1, 4096, false, 325, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "moss_pipe", "link": 23, "label": "moss_pipe", "type": "MOSS_TTS_PIPE", "localized_name": "moss_pipe"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "reference_audio", "link": 3, "label": "reference_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "reference_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 8, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "repetition_penalty"}, "name": "repetition_penalty", "label": "repetition_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repetition_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", 