58203], "widgets_values": ["真正赚钱的事，往往简单到让你不好意思。\n以前我也迷信过“高深模型”，上课、混圈子，结果一分没挣着。\n后来我才懂：复杂，是行动的天敌；赚钱，是简单的事，重复做。\n我靠什么？\n每天发一条视频，一年稿费300元；\n每天写一篇文章，200个粉丝。\n动作就一个，闭环跑得通，钱自然来。\n记住三句话：\n第一，现金不奖励认知，只奖励执行。\n别等完美，先跑通最小闭环，哪怕一天只赚1块。\n第二，反馈是迭代的燃料。\n做得烂？改！慢慢调，越做越顺，再上规模、加杠杆。\n第三，专注是最大的杠杆。\n别人上班八小时摸鱼四小时，成事的人十六小时死磕一件事。\n重复很无聊，但能坚持重复的人，早就跑赢了90%的同行。\n现在，去找你的“刷钱小闭环”。对你有启发？评论区留言，有钱一起赚。\n认知可以复杂，赚钱必须简单。干，就完了！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [1127.370361328125, 502.2282409667969], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 9, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "SaveAudioMP3", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 2, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [1085.1676025390625, -92.86967468261719], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 2, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "typ